        <mxCell id="1odllvxgz1vKziP6Jo5u-58" value="&lt;div&gt;«Requesting Entity» - PCF from planned Mtce. Buyer looks for «Entityinfo» of in stock material (Instant Info or APN221)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Buyer makes decision how to source the requested part.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;...if decides for «Inter-Entity» order.&amp;nbsp; (*is it centralized Buying Group?)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="RDU-i_oViCD79YajCuAX-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-870" y="-603" width="326" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="1odllvxgz1vKziP6Jo5u-59" value="&lt;div&gt;«Buyer» from requesting-Entity contacts the «supplying-Entity» . Instead of using «Tech.Query», use a Q-order, print and send.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Try to use Approval Control workflows to communicate. Fails due to lack of «Quotation-Vendor» wildcard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;«Supplying-Entity» replies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;«Buying-Entity» updates Q-order-details. Add or refer to Price Entry.&amp;nbsp; «Buying-Entity» confirms that Order can be sent.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="RDU-i_oViCD79YajCuAX-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-450" y="-618" width="410" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
